ents (M1) activities through its Discretionary Portfolio Management (DPM) services<\/p><p>Service Overview:<\/p><p><b>Discretionary Portfolio Management (DPM): <\/b>This service confers Arqaam discretionary authority to manage investment portfolios on behalf of clients, making strategic investment decisions within agreed parameters. This ensures a personalized approach to wealth management, aligning with client goals and market opportunities.<\/p><p><b>Investment Focus: <\/b>The DPM service will concentrate on building and managing portfolios that primarily invest in a diverse range of regional bonds and sukuks. The objective is to target optimal yields while maintaining low volatility. The portfolios will include both conventional financial instruments and those compliant with Shari\u2019ah principles, catering to a broad spectrum of investor preferences.<\/p><div><br><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3d463bd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3d463bd\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ad4e521\" data-id=\"ad4e521\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef7310f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ef7310f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArqaam KSA provides advising and arrangi